the timer event fires: 0x00000000
setting a new event clears the fired one: 0x00000000
a new timer is at 0: 0x00000001
start: 0x00000000
start again: 0x00000001
a running timer counts at least the time passed: 0x00000001
and not much more: 0x00000001
stop: 0x00000001
stop again: 0x00000000
